    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <string name="settings_section_faq">Frequently Asked Questions</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">Does FlowPebble require an internet connection or login?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">No. FlowPebble works 100% offline using a local Room SQLite database on your device. You never need to create an account or sign in.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">How do I create or delete my own micro-guide?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Tap the + Create a guide button on the main screen, enter a title and 3 to 5 steps, and tap Save. You can bookmark or remove custom guides anytime.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">How does the Pro Guide Vault work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Watching a single voluntary Rewarded Video Ad on the Today tab permanently unlocks 3 bonus micro-guides and quick-fill templates on your device.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">How is my privacy protected?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Your personal guides never leave your device unless you explicitly tap Share. For ads, we use Google UMP so you can control consent at any time.</string>

